<title>HUNGARY: Csopak plans 10 pct '96 dividend vs 8 pct.</title>
<headline>Csopak plans 10 pct '96 dividend vs 8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian retailer Csopak Szovetkezeti Rt said on Wednesday its management would offer the payout of a 10 percent dividend or 100 forints per share on the 1996 results.</p>
<p>The company, which is also involved in cosmetics and milling industries, paid an eight percent dividend on the 1995 results.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
